{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01659","headline":"杂曲歌辞 朗月行 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 朗月行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小时不识月，呼作白玉盘。\n又疑瑶台镜，飞在青云端。\n仙人垂两足，桂树作团团。\n白兔捣药成，问言与谁餐。\n蟾蜍蚀圜影，天明夜已残。\n羿昔落九乌，天人清且安。\n阴精此沦惑，去去不足观。\n忧来其如何？恻怆摧心肝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}